  "name": "eccentric",
  "title": "Eccentric orbit",
  "line": "An oval orbit sings in bursts at each close pass, and gravitational waves round it off.",
  "equation": "x'' = -M x / r^3 + (8/5) eta M^2 / r^3 [ (3 v^2 + 17 M / (3 r)) rdot n - (v^2 + 3 M / r) v ];  h_ij = 2 Qdd_ij^TT / R",
